        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Samburger's oddballs is a 3-game collection of my best games from 2025.<br><br>(listed in order of release)<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4220080/extras/d51cc5701fabc78600f73c1c68e032d1.poster.avif?t=1766642726\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4220080/extras/d51cc5701fabc78600f73c1c68e032d1.webm?t=1766642726\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4220080/extras/d51cc5701fabc78600f73c1c68e032d1.mp4?t=1766642726\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Athena's higher wire:<br> An arcade platformer with high difficulty and multiple modes including:<br>Classic mode: collect stars to advance levels with increasing difficulty.<br>Level select mode: play thorough a single level until you fail.<br>Hailstorm mode (a subsection of level selects mode): dodge unrelenting cannonfire for as long as you can!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4220080/extras/2343a9638b2cca66b565c2cc855c144d.poster.avif?t=1766642726\" width=388 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4220080/extras/2343a9638b2cca66b565c2cc855c144d.webm?t=1766642726\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4220080/extras/2343a9638b2cca66b565c2cc855c144d.mp4?t=1766642726\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Anncceleration: Collect hearts under a strict time limit by platforming through five open levels with slippery controls!<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4220080/extras/fbfc55a6a094304c19ab95bae42de1dd.poster.avif?t=1766642726\" width=250 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4220080/extras/fbfc55a6a094304c19ab95bae42de1dd.webm?t=1766642726\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4220080/extras/fbfc55a6a094304c19ab95bae42de1dd.mp4?t=1766642726\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Blastin blocks: Line up combos based on the color of your arrow and shoot bombs  for a high score in both classic and infinite modes!</p>",
