img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4220080/extras/fbfc55a6a094304c19ab95bae42de1dd.poster.avif?t=1766642726\" width=250 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4220080/extras/fbfc55a6a094304c19ab95bae42de1dd.webm?t=1766642726\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4220080/extras/fbfc55a6a094304c19ab95bae42de1dd.mp4?t=1766642726\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Blastin blocks: Line up combos based on the color of your arrow and shoot bombs  for a high score in both classic and infinite modes!</p>",
